- Every leaf MUST cite at least one supplied source ID in source_markers.
- Parent markers may be empty; they will inherit references from children.
- Source IDs are exactly S1, S2, etc., without brackets. Never invent IDs.
- Use at most 16 source IDs per node. Do not emit filenames, paths, HTML or links
